      "worked": "Each root of $P(x)=0$ occurs twice as often in $H(x)=P(x)^2=0$. Counting multiplicity,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Sum of roots of }H(x)=0&=2(3)\\\\\\text{Sum of roots of }H(x)=0&=6,\\\\\\text{Product of roots of }H(x)=0&=(-4)^2\\\\\\text{Product of roots of }H(x)=0&=16.\\end{align*}$$",
